---
description: Overriding methods automatically inherit the params behavior. To ease readability, this modifier should be explicitly used in the overriding method as well.
globs:
  - '**/*.cs'
alwaysApply: true
---
# Rule content

Noncompliant code example <pre>
class Base
{
public virtual void Method(params int[] numbers)
{
...
}
}
class Derived : Base
{
public override void Method(int[] numbers) // Noncompliant, the params is missing.
{
...
}
}
</pre>
 Compliant solution <pre>
class Base
{
public virtual void Method(params int[] numbers)
{
...
}
}
class Derived : Base
{
public override void Method(params int[] numbers)
{
...
}
}
</pre>
